{"blocks":[{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/entry/2012/03/02/6209378/0000.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"お待たせしました"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/entry/2012/03/02/6209378/0002.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"質問返したいと思います"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/entry/2012/03/02/6209378/0003.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/entry/2012/03/02/6209378/0005.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ななみんってそんな寝起き悪いの？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/entry/2012/03/02/6209378/0006.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"めちゃくちゃ悪いですよ"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/entry/2012/03/02/6209378/0007.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"多分乃木坂"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/entry/2012/03/02/6209378/0008.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"だと思います"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/entry/2012/03/02/6209378/0007.gif","alt":""},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/entry/2012/03/02/6209378/0007.gif","alt":""},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/entry/2012/03/02/6209378/0007.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/entry/2012/03/02/6209378/0005.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"エーリアンごっこ？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/entry/2012/03/02/6209378/0006.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"口じゃ説明しにくいので、是非、握手会とかで"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/entry/2012/03/02/6209378/0009.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ななみんandマイマイに聞いてみて下さい"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/entry/2012/03/02/6209378/0003.gif","alt":""},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/entry/2012/03/02/6209378/0007.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/entry/2012/03/02/6209378/0005.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ななみんって新幹線で移動して共演した仕事ってあったけ？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/entry/2012/03/02/6209378/0006.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ないですよ"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/entry/2012/03/02/6209378/0007.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"私ななみん好きで、ななみんの画像とかデータフォルダに保存してるんですよ"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/entry/2012/03/02/6209378/0007.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/entry/2012/03/02/6209378/0005.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"結構ティッシュ配りで皆に知ってもらえた？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/entry/2012/03/02/6209378/0006.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ハイ！多分知ってもらえたと思います！\nティッシュ配りに来てくださった方、受け取って下さった方ありがとう御座います！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/entry/2012/03/02/6209378/0005.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"夕べはグッスリ眠れたかな？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/entry/2012/03/02/6209378/0006.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ハイ！グッスリ眠れました"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/entry/2012/03/02/6209378/0007.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"朝もスカって目が覚めた"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/entry/2012/03/02/6209378/0010.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/entry/2012/03/02/6209378/0005.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"学校の友達で仲良いことかいる？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/entry/2012/03/02/6209378/0006.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ハイ！皆仲良くて！\n休憩時間とか皆で外でサッカーしたりして遊んでます"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/entry/2012/03/02/6209378/0007.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/entry/2012/03/02/6209378/0005.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"フジテレビの中はどんなだった？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/entry/2012/03/02/6209378/0006.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"とても大きくてビックリしました\n色んなポスターが張ってありました"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/entry/2012/03/02/6209378/0005.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"カラオケでよく歌う曲は？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/entry/2012/03/02/6209378/0006.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"うーん"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/entry/2012/03/02/6209378/0011.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"AKB48さんも歌いますしぃファンの方からアニソンのCD頂いて、最近アニソンも歌います"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/entry/2012/03/02/6209378/0007.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/entry/2012/03/02/6209378/0005.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"デビューまでの道のりは長かった？短かった？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/entry/2012/03/02/6209378/0006.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"とっても短かったです"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/entry/2012/03/02/6209378/0007.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ホントあっという間でした"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/entry/2012/03/02/6209378/0007.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/entry/2012/03/02/6209378/0005.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"またコメントしてもいいかな？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/entry/2012/03/02/6209378/0006.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"して下さると嬉しいです"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/entry/2012/03/02/6209378/0010.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"コメント見るたびめちゃんこパワーもらってます！ありがとう御座います"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/entry/2012/03/02/6209378/0003.gif","alt":""},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/entry/2012/03/02/6209378/0005.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"靴逆に履いたってことはわかりにくい靴だったのかな？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/entry/2012/03/02/6209378/0006.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"うーん"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/entry/2012/03/02/6209378/0011.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"でも普通の靴だった"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/entry/2012/03/02/6209378/0007.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/entry/2012/03/02/6209378/0005.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"かずみんみんは何をしてる写真なの？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/entry/2012/03/02/6209378/0006.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"なんかこれは、\n『見てみて筋肉！』\nって見せてる瞬間だったそうです"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/entry/2012/03/02/6209378/0007.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/entry/2012/03/02/6209378/0005.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"今はまってることは何ですか？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/entry/2012/03/02/6209378/0006.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"うーん"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/entry/2012/03/02/6209378/0011.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ヤッパリもうすぐ上京なんで、部屋の家具とか小物とか見るのにはまってますねぇ"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/entry/2012/03/02/6209378/0010.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/entry/2012/03/02/6209378/0005.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"まあやは意外とドジッコなのー？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/entry/2012/03/02/6209378/0006.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"もぅメンバーは天然だとかいろいろいってくるんですけど！\n私ぜんぜんそんなことありません"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/entry/2012/03/02/6209378/0007.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/entry/2012/03/02/6209378/0005.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"靴逆に履いて痛くならなかった？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/entry/2012/03/02/6209378/0006.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"痛くならなかったです"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/entry/2012/03/02/6209378/0007.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"アハハッ"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/entry/2012/03/02/6209378/0010.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/entry/2012/03/02/6209378/0005.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"靴逆に履くことよくあるの？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/entry/2012/03/02/6209378/0006.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"小学生のときはしょっちゅうでした"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/entry/2012/03/02/6209378/0007.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"でも最近は少しだけなんで大丈夫です"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/entry/2012/03/02/6209378/0010.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/entry/2012/03/02/6209378/0005.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ウドン美味しかった？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/entry/2012/03/02/6209378/0006.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"うんもぉヤバイよ！あれはすんごく美味しかったです"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/entry/2012/03/02/6209378/0010.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/entry/2012/03/02/6209378/0005.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"カキピーが目の前にあったら食べる？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/entry/2012/03/02/6209378/0006.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ハイ！絶対食べます"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/entry/2012/03/02/6209378/0007.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/entry/2012/03/02/6209378/0005.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"広島の人はウドンのことおうろんってゆうの？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/entry/2012/03/02/6209378/0006.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"いいえ"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/entry/2012/03/02/6209378/0007.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"いいません"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/entry/2012/03/02/6209378/0007.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"言ってみただけです"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/entry/2012/03/02/6209378/0007.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"Sorry"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/entry/2012/03/02/6209378/0005.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ファンからもらったプレゼントはどうしてる？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/entry/2012/03/02/6209378/0006.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"私は、携帯で１つ１つ写真撮らせて頂いてます"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/entry/2012/03/02/6209378/0003.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"もぅ嬉しすぎて(涙)\nメンバーにみてーとか自慢しちゃってます"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/entry/2012/03/02/6209378/0003.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ありがとう御座います"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/entry/2012/03/02/6209378/0003.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/entry/2012/03/02/6209378/0005.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"３月3日まあやのレーン行っていい？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/entry/2012/03/02/6209378/0006.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"えっ？来てくれるんですか？それならめちゃんこ嬉しいです"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/entry/2012/03/02/6209378/0009.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"まってます"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/entry/2012/03/02/6209378/0003.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"以上です"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/entry/2012/03/02/6209378/0009.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"質問ありがとうです"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/entry/2012/03/02/6209378/0009.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"この前の写真の年齢は、"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/entry/2012/03/02/6209378/0013.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"さいの時だそうです"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/entry/2012/03/02/6209378/0010.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"Bye"}],"source":"archive"}